  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Women Working Toward the Exportation of Artisan Foods: An Expression of Uruguayan Culture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delicias Criollas will develop 13 affiliated enterprises managed and supplied by 150 low- income rural women in 10 Uruguayan departments through training and technical assistance in the production of traditional foods, quality control and marketing. The women will benefit from increased income and some 3,750 other individuals will benefit indirectly from the project. (UR-181)</narrative>
  </description>
